* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VIN VCONT2 VCONT3 VCONT5 VCONT4 VP VCONT1 VB5 VB1 VREF VB2
.model DIODE D(IS=1e-14 N=1)
CFLY VX1 VX2 1p
CO VP VN 1p
COP VP VSS 1p
D1 VN VX2 DIODE
L1 VX1 VX3 1n
M1 net8 VCONT1 VIN VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
